# World Generation vs Legacy Map Generator

**Active work:** World Generation Ruleset, Generate Map, and Auto-Paint (paint / rebuild walls).

Code and data live under `src/maps/autoPaint/`, World Generation Ruleset UI, and `autoPaintRulesets.json`.

**Locked — do not edit for new features:**

- Tools → Legacy Map Generator (read-only in UI)
- Properties → Legacy Map Generator (frozen location generators)
- `src/maps/generators/*`, `mapGenerators.js` location builders, `templateDeckStyle`, deck style JSON

Do not change Legacy code to fix World Generation / Auto-Paint behaviour. Do not add imports from World Generation into Legacy, or from Legacy generators into `autoPaint/`.

Shared map infrastructure only (map JSON, tiles, Template Pieces, Dev Edit shell) may be used by both; generator algorithms stay separate.
